<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>酷安话题-DIY</title><link>https://www.coolapk.com/</link><atom:link href="http://10.0.0.5:1200/coolapk/huati/DIY" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>酷安话题-DIY - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 03:08:59 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>60</ttl><item><title>车载无线充电50w已经全协议了，怎么没有桌面产品，或者有没有什么合适的车载模块手搓方案[墨镜滑稽]#充电头# #DIY#</title><description>&lt;p&gt;车载无线充电50w已经全协议了，怎么没有桌面产品，或者有没有什么合适的车载模块手搓方案[墨镜滑稽]&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E5%85%85%E7%94%B5%E5%A4%B4?type=0&quot;&gt;#充电头#&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/DIY?type=0&quot;&gt;#DIY#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/74859664</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/74859664</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 02:19:55 GMT</pubDate><author>可变光圈</author></item><item><title>华为二合一平板首开 ios16 matebook e go 2023 暂时无驱动 全部流程由本地 qwen3.8 flash next 模型完成 视频见 【华为二合一平板全网首开 iOS 16-哔哩哔哩】 查...</title><description>&lt;p&gt;华为二合一平板首开 ios16
